I'm putting it as a question.

1095
00:41:29,874 --> 00:41:31,874
Yeah.

1096
00:41:31,874 --> 00:41:34,874
It certainly seems to be...

1097
00:41:34,874 --> 00:41:35,874
No, no.

1098
00:41:35,874 --> 00:41:36,874
Look into it.

1099
00:41:36,874 --> 00:41:37,874
Let's find out.

1100
00:41:38,874 --> 00:41:42,874
What do you mean by knowledge?

1101
00:41:42,874 --> 00:41:45,874
What are you talking about there?

1102
00:41:45,874 --> 00:41:50,874
The word to know, huh?

1103
00:41:50,874 --> 00:41:54,874
Do I know you?

1104
00:41:54,874 --> 00:41:59,874
Or I have known you?

1105
00:41:59,874 --> 00:42:04,874
Hmm-hmm.

1106
00:42:04,874 --> 00:42:06,874
I can never say I know you.

1107
00:42:06,874 --> 00:42:11,374
Literally, I mean actually, it would be

1108
00:42:11,374 --> 00:42:15,874
an abomination to say I know you.

1109
00:42:15,874 --> 00:42:16,874
Right.

1110
00:42:16,874 --> 00:42:20,874
Hmm-hmm.

1111
00:42:20,874 --> 00:42:25,874
I have known you.

1112
00:42:25,874 --> 00:42:28,374
Because you, in the meantime,

1113
00:42:28,374 --> 00:42:30,874
are changing, you have all your...

1114
00:42:30,874 --> 00:42:31,874
You follow?

1115
00:42:31,874 --> 00:42:32,874
There is a great deal

1116
00:42:32,874 --> 00:42:33,874
of movement going on in you.

1117
00:42:33,874 --> 00:42:35,874
Right.

1118
00:42:35,874 --> 00:42:39,374
And to say I know you means I am

1119
00:42:39,374 --> 00:42:42,874
acquainted or intimate with that movement which is all

1120
00:42:42,874 --> 00:42:44,874
going on in you.

1121
00:42:44,874 --> 00:42:46,874
There'd be an impudence on my

1122
00:42:46,874 --> 00:42:48,874
part to say I know you.

1123
00:42:48,874 --> 00:42:49,874
Right.

1124
00:42:49,874 --> 00:42:50,874
That's right.

1125
00:42:50,874 --> 00:42:52,374
Because not only that, that would be denying

1126
00:42:52,374 --> 00:42:53,874
your effect on me, which is causing me...

1127
00:42:53,874 --> 00:42:55,374
Which is a change from

1128
00:42:55,374 --> 00:42:56,874
knowing you, from being with you.

1129
00:42:56,874 --> 00:43:01,874
So knowing, to know is the path.

1130
00:43:01,874 --> 00:43:02,874
Huh?

1131
00:43:02,874 --> 00:43:03,874
Would you say to that?

1132
00:43:03,874 --> 00:43:04,874
Yes.

1133
00:43:04,874 --> 00:43:06,874
I mean, what we know is the past and...

1134
00:43:06,874 --> 00:43:07,874
Knowledge is the past.

1135
00:43:07,874 --> 00:43:09,374
But I mean, the danger is

1136
00:43:09,374 --> 00:43:10,874
that we call it the present.

1137
00:43:10,874 --> 00:43:11,874
I mean, is that...

1138
00:43:11,874 --> 00:43:15,874
See, the danger is that we call knowledge the present.

1139
00:43:15,874 --> 00:43:16,874
That's just it.

1140
00:43:16,874 --> 00:43:21,374
In other words, if we said the past is

1141
00:43:21,374 --> 00:43:25,874
the past, then wouldn't you say it needn't fragment?

1142
00:43:25,874 --> 00:43:26,874
What's that?

1143
00:43:26,874 --> 00:43:29,374
If we said, if we recognized or we acknowledged

1144
00:43:29,374 --> 00:43:31,874
that the past is the past, it's gone, and

1145
00:43:31,874 --> 00:43:32,874
therefore what we know is past...

1146
00:43:32,874 --> 00:43:33,874
Past, yes.

1147
00:43:33,874 --> 00:43:35,874
Then that would not introduce fragmentation.

1148
00:43:35,874 --> 00:43:36,874
That would...

1149
00:43:36,874 --> 00:43:37,874
Quite right.

1150
00:43:37,874 --> 00:43:39,874
But if we say what we know is

1151
00:43:39,874 --> 00:43:41,874
what is present now, then we are introducing fragmentation.

1152
00:43:41,874 --> 00:43:43,874
Quite right, quite.

1153
00:43:43,874 --> 00:43:47,874
Because we are imposing this partial knowledge on the whole.

1154
00:43:47,874 --> 00:43:51,874
So would you say knowledge is

1155
00:43:51,874 --> 00:43:55,874
one of the factors of fragmentation?

1156
00:43:55,874 --> 00:44:00,874
Sir, that's saying an awful...

1157
00:44:00,874 --> 00:44:01,874
You follow?

1158
00:44:01,874 --> 00:44:02,874
It's a large pill to swallow.

1159
00:44:02,874 --> 00:44:05,874
But also, you're implying there are other factors.

1160
00:44:05,874 --> 00:44:06,874
Yes.

1161
00:44:06,874 --> 00:44:07,874
But...

1162
00:44:07,874 --> 00:44:10,874
And that may be the only factor.

1163
00:44:10,874 --> 00:44:11,874
Yes.

1164
00:44:11,874 --> 00:44:13,874
But, you see, I think we should look at

1165
00:44:13,874 --> 00:44:15,874
it this way, that people have hoped through knowledge

1166
00:44:15,874 --> 00:44:16,874
to overcome fragmentation...

1167
00:44:16,874 --> 00:44:17,874
Of course.

1168
00:44:17,874 --> 00:44:19,874
...to produce a system of knowledge

1169
00:44:19,874 --> 00:44:21,874
that will put it all together.

1170
00:44:21,874 --> 00:44:24,874
Again, Bronowski's ascent of man

1171
00:44:24,874 --> 00:44:27,874
through knowledge, emphasizing knowledge, knowledge,

1172
00:44:27,874 --> 00:44:30,874
knowledge.

1173
00:44:30,874 --> 00:44:34,874
Is that not one of the major

1174
00:44:34,874 --> 00:44:38,874
factors, or perhaps the factor of fragmentation?

1175
00:44:38,874 --> 00:44:43,874
My experience tells me I'm a Hindu.

1176
00:44:43,874 --> 00:44:47,874
My experience tells me I know what God is.

1177
00:44:47,874 --> 00:44:50,874
Well, wouldn't we better say that confusion

1178
00:44:50,874 --> 00:44:53,874
about the role of knowledge is what's the

1179
00:44:53,874 --> 00:44:54,874
cause of fragmentation?

1180
00:44:54,874 --> 00:44:55,874
Yes.

1181
00:44:55,874 --> 00:44:56,874
In other words, knowledge itself.

1182
00:44:56,874 --> 00:44:58,874
See, if you say knowledge is always the cause...

1183
00:44:58,874 --> 00:44:59,874
No.

1184
00:44:59,874 --> 00:45:01,874
...then I said we began by asking...

1185
00:45:01,874 --> 00:45:02,874
Yes, I mean, let's make it clear.

1186
00:45:02,874 --> 00:45:03,874
...yes, of course, of course.

1187
00:45:03,874 --> 00:45:06,874
So that's what we said yesterday in our talk.

1188
00:45:06,874 --> 00:45:09,874
Art is putting things in its right place.

1189
00:45:09,874 --> 00:45:12,874
So I'm putting knowledge in its right place.

1190
00:45:12,874 --> 00:45:13,874
Right.

1191
00:45:13,874 --> 00:45:14,874
Yes, so we're not confused about it anymore.

1192
00:45:14,874 --> 00:45:15,874
Of course.

1193
00:45:15,874 --> 00:45:16,874
Right.

1194
00:45:16,874 --> 00:45:17,874
Right.

1195
00:45:17,874 --> 00:45:19,374
You know, I was just going

1196
00:45:19,374 --> 00:45:20,874
to bring in this rather interesting example.

1197
00:45:20,874 --> 00:45:23,374
A patient of mine was teaching me something the

1198
00:45:23,374 --> 00:45:25,874
other day, and she said, I have the feeling

1199
00:45:25,874 --> 00:45:28,874
that as a doctor, the way you operate is...

1200
00:45:28,874 --> 00:45:30,944
She says, there's a group of doctors who've

1201
00:45:30,944 --> 00:45:33,014
seen certain kinds of patients, and if they

1202
00:45:33,014 --> 00:45:35,324
do X to them, they'll get certain

1203
00:45:35,324 --> 00:45:37,634
kind of effects, and they achieve things.

1204
00:45:37,634 --> 00:45:39,574
She says, you're not talking to me.

1205
00:45:39,574 --> 00:45:42,874
You're doing this to me, hoping you'll get this result.

1206
00:45:42,874 --> 00:45:43,874
Quite.

1207
00:45:43,874 --> 00:45:44,874
Quite.

1208
00:45:44,874 --> 00:45:47,874
That's what you're saying.

1209
00:45:47,874 --> 00:45:50,394
No, a little more so than that.

1210
00:45:50,394 --> 00:45:53,634
We are saying, both Dr. Bohm and

1211
00:45:53,634 --> 00:45:56,874
I, we are saying knowledge has its place.

1212
00:45:56,874 --> 00:45:57,874
Right.

1213
00:45:57,874 --> 00:45:59,874
Now let's go into that.

1214
00:45:59,874 --> 00:46:02,374
Like driving a car, learning a language, and so on.

1215
00:46:02,374 --> 00:46:04,374
Yes, we could say, why is that not fragmentation?

1216
00:46:04,374 --> 00:46:05,374
We could make it clear.

1217
00:46:05,374 --> 00:46:07,624
You see that, in other words, if we

1218
00:46:07,624 --> 00:46:09,874
drive a car using knowledge, that is not fragmentation.

1219
00:46:09,874 --> 00:46:10,874
No.

1220
00:46:10,874 --> 00:46:13,874
But when knowledge is used psychologically...

1221
00:46:13,874 --> 00:46:15,374
Yes, but I mean, one should

1222
00:46:15,374 --> 00:46:16,874
see more clearly what the difference is.

1223
00:46:16,874 --> 00:46:18,874
You see, that is the car itself, as I

1224
00:46:18,874 --> 00:46:20,874
see it, is a part, a limited part, and therefore

1225
00:46:20,874 --> 00:46:22,874
it can be handled by knowledge.

1226
00:46:22,874 --> 00:46:24,874
You mean it's a limited part of life.

1227
00:46:24,874 --> 00:46:25,874
Of life, yes.

1228
00:46:25,874 --> 00:46:26,874
Right.

1229
00:46:26,874 --> 00:46:27,874
And so and so.

1230
00:46:27,874 --> 00:46:28,874
I mean the whole of me, you see.

1231
00:46:28,874 --> 00:46:29,874
That's right.

1232
00:46:29,874 --> 00:46:31,374
And therefore I'm applying a part to the whole.

1233
00:46:31,374 --> 00:46:33,374
I'm trying to cover the whole by a part.

1234
00:46:33,374 --> 00:46:36,124
When knowledge assumes it understands

1235
00:46:36,124 --> 00:46:38,874
the whole, then begins the mystery.

1236
00:46:38,874 --> 00:46:40,874
But it's often very tricky, because I'm

1237
00:46:40,874 --> 00:46:42,874
not explicitly spelling out that I understand

1238
00:46:42,874 --> 00:46:45,124
the whole, but it's implicit by saying, everything

1239
00:46:45,124 --> 00:46:47,374
is this way, or I am this way.

1240
00:46:47,374 --> 00:46:48,374
Quite, quite.

1241
00:46:48,374 --> 00:46:49,624
But it implies that the

1242
00:46:49,624 --> 00:46:50,874
whole is this way, you see.

1243
00:46:50,874 --> 00:46:52,374
The whole of me, the whole

1244
00:46:52,374 --> 00:46:53,874
of life, the whole of the world.

1245
00:46:53,874 --> 00:46:54,874
Yes.

1246
00:46:54,874 --> 00:46:55,874
Well, what Krishnaji was saying.

1247
00:46:55,874 --> 00:46:57,874
I mean, like, I know you.

1248
00:46:57,874 --> 00:46:59,774
That's how we do with ourselves.

1249
00:46:59,774 --> 00:47:02,414
We say, I know this about me, rather than

1250
00:47:02,414 --> 00:47:05,054
being open to the new event, or even being

1251
00:47:05,054 --> 00:47:06,054
aware of the fragmentation.

1252
00:47:06,054 --> 00:47:07,054
Yes.

1253
00:47:07,054 --> 00:47:08,504
When I'm saying about you, then I shouldn't

1254
00:47:08,504 --> 00:47:09,954
say I know all, because you're not a limited

1255
00:47:09,954 --> 00:47:10,954
part like a machine.

1256
00:47:10,954 --> 00:47:11,954
You see, that's what's implied.

1257
00:47:11,954 --> 00:47:14,164
You see, the machine is fairly limited, and

1258
00:47:14,164 --> 00:47:16,374
we can know all that's relevant about it,

1259
00:47:16,374 --> 00:47:17,894
or almost all anyway.

1260
00:47:17,894 --> 00:47:18,894
Sometimes it breaks down.

1261
00:47:18,894 --> 00:47:19,894
Quite, quite.

1262
00:47:19,894 --> 00:47:22,884
But when it comes to another person,

1263
00:47:22,884 --> 00:47:25,874
that's immensely beyond what you could really know.

1264
00:47:25,874 --> 00:47:28,874
I mean, that's… the past

1265
00:47:28,874 --> 00:47:31,874
experience doesn't tell you the essence.

1266
00:47:31,874 --> 00:47:38,374
Are you saying, Dr. Bob, that when

1267
00:47:38,374 --> 00:47:44,874
knowledge spills over into the psychological field…

1268
00:47:44,874 --> 00:47:47,124
Well, also in another field, which

1269
00:47:47,124 --> 00:47:49,374
I call the whole in general.

1270
00:47:49,374 --> 00:47:51,234
You see, sometimes it spills over into

1271
00:47:51,234 --> 00:47:53,094
the philosophical field when man tries to make

1272
00:47:53,094 --> 00:47:54,854
a metaphysical view of the whole universe.

1273
00:47:54,854 --> 00:47:55,854
Of course.

1274
00:47:55,854 --> 00:47:57,074
That's, of course.

1275
00:47:57,074 --> 00:48:00,154
I mean, that's purely theoretical, and

1276
00:48:00,154 --> 00:48:03,234
that has no meaning to me personally.

1277
00:48:03,234 --> 00:48:05,164
But I mean, that's one of the

1278
00:48:05,164 --> 00:48:07,094
ways in which it does that, you see.

1279
00:48:07,094 --> 00:48:08,094
Yes.

1280
00:48:08,094 --> 00:48:09,094
It goes wrong.

1281
00:48:09,094 --> 00:48:11,174
I mean, see, some people feel that when

1282
00:48:11,174 --> 00:48:13,254
they are discussing metaphysics of the whole universe,

1283
00:48:13,254 --> 00:48:14,254
it is not psychological.

1284
00:48:14,254 --> 00:48:18,514
It probably is, but the motives behind it are psychological.

1285
00:48:18,514 --> 00:48:21,184
But some people may feel that they are

1286
00:48:21,184 --> 00:48:23,854
making a theory of the universe, not discussing psychology.

1287
00:48:23,854 --> 00:48:25,854
I mean, I think it's a matter of getting…

1288
00:48:25,854 --> 00:48:26,854
The language.

1289
00:48:26,854 --> 00:48:27,854
The language, quite.

1290
00:48:27,854 --> 00:48:30,264
Well, I mean, you see this with what

1291
00:48:30,264 --> 00:48:32,674
you're saying, or what he's saying, can be extended

1292
00:48:32,674 --> 00:48:34,114
to the way people are.

1293
00:48:34,114 --> 00:48:36,234
They have a metaphysics about other people.

1294
00:48:36,234 --> 00:48:40,094
I know all other people are not to be trusted.

1295
00:48:40,094 --> 00:48:41,094
Quite.

1296
00:48:41,094 --> 00:48:42,724
Or you have a metaphysics about yourself,

1297
00:48:42,724 --> 00:48:44,354
saying, I am such and such a person.

1298
00:48:44,354 --> 00:48:45,354
Right.

1299
00:48:45,354 --> 00:48:47,104
And I have a metaphysics that life

1300
00:48:47,104 --> 00:48:48,854
is hopeless and I must depend on these…

1301
00:48:48,854 --> 00:48:49,854
No.

1302
00:48:49,854 --> 00:48:51,474
All that I can say is…

1303
00:48:51,474 --> 00:48:53,094
we can say is, we are fragmented.

1304
00:48:53,094 --> 00:48:54,094
That's a fact.

1305
00:48:54,094 --> 00:48:55,094
Right.

1306
00:48:55,094 --> 00:49:01,253
And I am aware of those fragmented minds.

1307
00:49:01,253 --> 00:49:03,173
There is an awareness of

1308
00:49:03,173 --> 00:49:05,094
the fragmented mind because of conflict.

1309
00:49:05,094 --> 00:49:06,094
Right.

1310
00:49:06,094 --> 00:49:07,094
That's right.

1311
00:49:07,094 --> 00:49:10,893
You were saying before we have got to

1312
00:49:10,893 --> 00:49:14,693
have an approach where we're not aware just because

1313
00:49:14,693 --> 00:49:15,693
of that.

1314
00:49:15,693 --> 00:49:16,693
Yes.

1315
00:49:16,693 --> 00:49:17,693
Right?

1316
00:49:17,693 --> 00:49:18,693
That's right.

1317
00:49:18,693 --> 00:49:19,693
Are we coming to that?

1318
00:49:19,693 --> 00:49:20,693
Coming?

1319
00:49:20,693 --> 00:49:21,693
Yes.

1320
00:49:21,693 --> 00:49:22,593
So from there, conflict, I say,

1321
00:49:22,593 --> 00:49:23,494
what is the source of this conflict?

1322
00:49:23,494 --> 00:49:24,494
Mm-hmm.

1323
00:49:24,494 --> 00:49:28,213
Source is fragmentation, obviously.

1324
00:49:28,213 --> 00:49:31,134
Now what brings about fragmentation?

1325
00:49:31,134 --> 00:49:37,094
What is the cause of this, behind it?

1326
00:49:37,094 --> 00:49:39,094
We said perhaps knowledge.

1327
00:49:39,094 --> 00:49:41,094
Perhaps knowledge.

1328
00:49:41,094 --> 00:49:47,654
Knowledge, psychologically I use knowledge.

1329
00:49:47,654 --> 00:49:50,654
I know myself.

1330
00:49:50,654 --> 00:49:53,494
I really don't know because I'm changing, moving.

1331
00:49:53,494 --> 00:49:54,494
Mm-hmm.

1332
00:49:54,494 --> 00:49:59,494
Or I use knowledge for my own satisfaction.

1333
00:49:59,494 --> 00:50:00,494
Wow.

1334
00:50:00,494 --> 00:50:05,374
For my position, for my success, for

1335
00:50:05,374 --> 00:50:10,254
becoming a great man in the world.

1336
00:50:10,254 --> 00:50:12,954
I am a great scholar.

1337
00:50:12,954 --> 00:50:15,504
I have read a million books and

1338
00:50:15,504 --> 00:50:18,054
I can tell you all about it.

1339
00:50:18,054 --> 00:50:23,494
It gives me a position, a prestige, a status.

1340
00:50:23,494 --> 00:50:24,494
Mm-hmm.

1341
00:50:24,494 --> 00:50:28,014
So is that it?

1342
00:50:28,014 --> 00:50:32,853
That fragmentation takes place when there

1343
00:50:32,853 --> 00:50:37,693
is a desire for security, psychological security,

1344
00:50:37,693 --> 00:50:40,494
which prevents biological security.

1345
00:50:40,494 --> 00:50:41,494
Mm-hmm.

1346
00:50:41,494 --> 00:50:42,494
Right.

1347
00:50:42,494 --> 00:50:43,494
Mm-hmm.

1348
00:50:43,494 --> 00:50:44,494
You see, right.

1349
00:50:44,494 --> 00:50:51,854
And therefore security may be one of the factors.

1350
00:50:51,854 --> 00:50:52,854
Security in knowledge.

1351
00:50:53,494 --> 00:50:54,494
Right.

1352
00:50:54,494 --> 00:50:55,494
Used wrongly.

1353
00:50:55,494 --> 00:50:57,914
Well, could you say now that some sort of

1354
00:50:57,914 --> 00:51:00,334
mistake has been made that, say, a man feels

1355
00:51:00,334 --> 00:51:03,744
insecure biologically and he thinks, you know, what

1356
00:51:03,744 --> 00:51:07,154
shall I do, and he makes a mistake in

1357
00:51:07,154 --> 00:51:09,824
the sense that he tries

1358
00:51:09,824 --> 00:51:12,494
to obtain psychological sense of security?

1359
00:51:12,494 --> 00:51:13,494
Yes.

1360
00:51:13,494 --> 00:51:15,494
By thinking, you know, by knowledge.

1361
00:51:15,494 --> 00:51:17,494
By knowledge, yes.

1362
00:51:17,494 --> 00:51:18,494
That's…

1363
00:51:18,494 --> 00:51:19,494
By knowing.

1364
00:51:19,494 --> 00:51:20,494
Yeah.

1365
00:51:20,494 --> 00:51:21,494
By repeating himself.

1366
00:51:21,494 --> 00:51:22,494
